#: src/Admin/WithdrawalStatusFields.php:74
msgid "Withdrawal status"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/WithdrawalStatusFields.php:76
msgid "Defines whether this product is excluded from the EU right of withdrawal and which checkout consent (if any) is shown to the customer. Categories can set a default that products inherit."
